      *################################################################*00010000
      *                                                                 00020000
      * FD Trade Finance                                                00030000
      *                                                                 00040000
      * Copy-area R115IPA0.                                             00050000
      *                                                                 00060000
      * Interface for all database access on table TF_Part_Amount.      00070000
      *                                                                 00080000
      * The interface kan read one spesific occurence,                  00090000
      * or several occurences, fully or partly qualified with           00100000
      * from- and to- values.                                           00110000
      *                                                                 00120000
      * When reading several occurences, one must always start with     00130000
      * -In-Get-1st, and continue with -In-Get-Next.                    00140000
      *                                                                 00150000
      * NB!  There are several key-fields, which may be used            00160000
      *      differently depending on the need.                         00170000
      *      See seperate description below.                            00180000
      *                                                                 00190000
      *                                                                 00200000
      * An ordinary Select call may look like this:                     00210000
      *                                                                 00220000
      *    Initialize                          R115IPA0-Part-Amount     00230000
      *    Set   R115IPA0-Version        To    True                     00240000
      *    Set   R115IPA0-In-Select      To    True                     00250000
      *                                                                 00260000
      * One of these:                                                   00270003
      * 1) Set   R115IPA0-In-Actual      To    True                     00280003
      * 2) Set   R115IPA0-In-Work        To    True                     00290003
      *                                                                 00300003
      * One of these:                                                   00310000
      * 1) Move  &fin-inst-id            To    R115IPA0-In-Fin-Inst-ID  00320000
      * 2) Move  &fin-inst-no            To    R115IPA0-In-Fin-Inst-No  00330000
      *                                                                 00340000
      *    Move  &contract-type          To    R115IPA0-In-Contract-Type00350000
      *    Move  &contract-no            To    R115IPA0-In-Contract-No  00360000
      *    Move  &currency (ISO 4217)    To    R115IPA0-In-CA-Currency  00370000
      *    Move  &part-amount seq.no     To    R115IPA0-In-PA-Seq-No    00380000
      *                                                                 00390000
      *    Call  'F115IPA0'              Using R115IPA0-Part-Amount     00400000
      *                                        R7919999-Error-Area      00410000
      *    End-Call                                                     00420000
      *                                                                 00430000
      *    Evaluate True                                                00440000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 00450000
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       00460000
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00470000
      *                                                                 00480000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Error                                 00490000
      *        ...not found...                                          00500000
      *                                                                 00510000
      *      When R7919999-Return-OK                                    00520000
      *        ...found...                                              00530000
      *                                                                 00540000
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 00550000
      *                                                                 00560000
      *################################################################*00570000
