      *      !   ! from "Like" to "=".                           !    ! 00610008
      *      !   ! Removed -In-From-Contr-No (kept as redef.).   !    ! 00620009
      *      !   ! Removed -In-To-Contr-No.                      !    ! 00630012
      *010999!HLR! Added -Excess-Amount                          !LG10! 00640007
      *250899!HLR! Added -In-Status as cursor qualification      !LG10! 00650007
