         03  R115IPA0-Part-Amount.                                      00700000
      *                                                                 00710000
           05  R115IPA0-Version-No              Pic  X(08).             00720000
             88  R115IPA0-Version                    Value '20000619'.  00730009
      *                                                                 00740000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*00750000
      *                                                                 00760000
           05  R115IPA0-Qualification.                                  00770000
      *                                                                 00780000
             10  R115IPA0-In-Action             Pic  X(16).             00790000
               88  R115IPA0-In-Get-1st               Value 'GET-1ST'.   00800000
               88  R115IPA0-In-Get-Next              Value 'GET-NEXT'.  00810000
               88  R115IPA0-In-Select                Value 'SELECT'.    00820000
               88  R115IPA0-In-Insert                Value 'INSERT'.    00830000
               88  R115IPA0-In-Update                Value 'UPDATE'.    00840000
               88  R115IPA0-In-Delete                Value 'DELETE'.    00850000
               88  R115IPA0-In-Upd-Status            Value 'UPDSTA'.    00851021
      *                                                                 00860000
      * There are several key-fields, which may be used differently     00870000
      * depending on the need.                                          00880000
      *                                                                 00890000
      * In-Table must be set whatever the desired action is.            00900003
      *                                                                 00910003
      * For Insert, all relevant fields in the Data group must be       00920002
      * populated. However, PA-Seq-No will be created by the interface. 00930002
      *     - Fin-Inst-No or Fin-Inst-ID                                00940002
      *     - Contract-Type                                             00950002
      *     - Contract-No                                               00960002
      *     - Currency                                                  00970002
      *                                                                 00980002
      * For Select, Update and Delete, use:                             00990002
      *     - Fin-Inst-No or Fin-Inst-ID                                01000000
      *     - Contract-Type                                             01010000
      *     - Contract-No                                               01020000
      *     - Currency                                                  01030000
      *     - Part Amount Sequence Number                               01040000
      *                                                                 01050000
      * For cursor (Get-1st / Get-Next), use:                           01060000
      *     - Optional: Fin-Inst-No or Fin-Inst-ID                      01070000
      *     - Optional: Contract-Type                                   01080000
      *     - Optional: Contract-No                                     01090010
      *     - Optional: Currency and Part Amount Seq.no                 01100000
      *     - Optional: Status (only with Fin-Inst-No)                  01110006
      *                                                                 01120000
             10  R115IPA0-In-Key.                                       01130000
      *                                                                 01140000
               15  R115IPA0-In-Table-Version    Pic  X(16).             01150004
                 88  R115IPA0-In-Actual              Value 'ACTUAL'.    01160003
                 88  R115IPA0-In-Work                Value 'WORK'.      01170003
      *                                                                 01180003
      *        It is optional wether you use Fin-Inst-No or Fin-Inst-ID.01190000
               15  R115IPA0-In-Fin-Inst.                                01200000
                 20  R115IPA0-In-Fin-Inst-No    Pic  X(18).             01210000
                 20  R115IPA0-In-Fin-Inst-ID    Pic S9(18)       Comp-3.01220000
      *                                                                 01230000
      *        Contract-Type and -No is mandatory for                   01240000
      *        Select/Update/Delete.                                    01250002
               15  R115IPA0-In-Contract.                                01260000
                 20  R115IPA0-In-Contract-Type  Pic  X(03).             01270000
                 20  R115IPA0-In-Contract-No    Pic S9(07)       Comp-3.01280000
      *                                                                 01290009
      *          Temporary, as this field is still in use.              01300009
                 20  R115IPA0-In-From-Contr-No  Redefines               01310009
                                                R115IPA0-In-Contract-No 01320009
                                                Pic S9(07)       Comp-3.01330009
      *                                                                 01340000
      *        These fields are mandatory for                           01350000
      *        Select/Update/Delete.                                    01360002
               15  R115IPA0-In-Part-Amount.                             01370000
                 20  R115IPA0-In-CA-Currency    Pic  X(03).             01380000
                 20  R115IPA0-In-PA-Seq-No      Pic S9(04)       Comp.  01390000
      *                                                                 01400000
      *        Status is optional for Get-1st / Get-Next.               01410006
               15  R115IPA0-In-Status           Pic  X(12).             01420006
      *                                                                 01430006
      * When performing a Get-1st-call one may ask for the total        01440000
      * number of rows complying with the qualification.                01450000
      *                                                                 01460000
             10  R115IPA0-In-Code-Count         Pic  X(10).             01470000
               88  R115IPA0-In-CC-Count              Value 'COUNT'.     01480000
      *                                                                 01490000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01500000
